{"seq":2,"slug":"fluid-performance","title":"流体性能与 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/practice/fluid-performance","wordCount":1409,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流体性能与-lod\">流体性能与 LOD</h1><p>流体是游戏里最容易吃光帧预算的系统之一。一个 60 帧的游戏每帧只有 16.6 毫秒，流体往往只分到 2-4 毫秒，却要在里面跑邻域查找、压力迭代、表面重建——每一步都贵。一片看起来普通的水，背后可能藏着几十万次邻居搜索和上千次泊松迭代。这一篇讲怎么让流体在这点预算里活下来：用空间哈希压垮邻域搜索、用 LOD 按距离分级、用多帧摊销和粒子预算守住帧率，让同一套流体在 PS5 和手机上都能跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-流体的三大瓶颈\">核心概念：流体的三大瓶颈</h2><p>先看钱花在哪。流体的开销集中在三处，对应三类方法的痛点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[流体每帧开销] --&gt; B[邻域查找&lt;br/&gt;粒子法 SPH FLIP]&#10;  A --&gt; C[压力 解算迭代&lt;br/&gt;网格 投影 泊松]&#10;  A --&gt; D[表面重建&lt;br/&gt;渲染 Marching 屏幕空间]&#10;  B --&gt; E[对策 空间哈希 O n]&#10;  C --&gt; F[对策 限迭代次数 不解到底]&#10;  D --&gt; G[对策 屏幕空间 降分辨率]\">graph TD\n  A[流体每帧开销] --&gt; B[邻域查找&lt;br/&gt;粒子法 SPH FLIP]\n  A --&gt; C[压力 解算迭代&lt;br/&gt;网格 投影 泊松]\n  A --&gt; D[表面重建&lt;br/&gt;渲染 Marching 屏幕空间]\n  B --&gt; E[对策 空间哈希 O n]\n  C --&gt; F[对策 限迭代次数 不解到底]\n  D --&gt; G[对策 屏幕空间 降分辨率]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>出现在</th>\n<th>朴素成本</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>邻域查找</td>\n<td>SPH/FLIP 粒子法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 空间哈希</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压力投影</td>\n<td>欧拉/FLIP 网格</td>\n<td>解到收敛很贵</td>\n<td>固定 20-40 次迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表面重建</td>\n<td>渲染</td>\n<td>体素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>屏幕空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>像素</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{像素})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">像素</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类对策分别在三章已埋下伏笔，本篇把它们统一成可落地的性能纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间哈希-压垮邻域查找\">空间哈希：压垮邻域查找</h2><p>粒子法最大的钱坑是「每个粒子要找它光滑半径内的邻居」，朴素两两比较是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——十万粒子就是百亿次比较，彻底跑不动。标准解法是均匀网格空间哈希：把空间切成边长等于光滑半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的格子，每个粒子按坐标算出所属格子的哈希值，归入该格子的桶。查邻居时只需检查粒子所在格子及相邻 26 个格子（3D），把搜索范围从「全场」缩到「常数个格子」，整体降到近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>工程上 GPU 实现的关键是排序：把粒子按格子哈希值排序，同格子粒子在内存里连续，邻域遍历就是顺序读取（缓存友好，对应<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">数据导向与缓存</a>的思想）。2025 年一项 Unity 大规模粒子工作正是用 Count Sort 加并行前缀扫描做哈希排序，把传统 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 邻域搜索压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，突破十万粒子还保持实时（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2076-3417/15/17/9706\">MDPI 2025</a>）。这套加速结构与<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/spatial-acceleration\">空间加速结构</a>在碰撞检测里的宽相位（broad-phase）哈希是同一族技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lod-按距离和重要性分级\">LOD：按距离和重要性分级</h2><p>不是所有水都值得高保真。流体 LOD 的核心是把<a href=\"../foundations/fluid-basics-games\">游戏流体基础</a>的保真谱按空间动态切换：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按距离切方法</strong>：远海只跑<a href=\"../realtime-water/ocean-fft\">海洋 FFT 频谱</a>（低分辨率 tile），中景上<a href=\"../realtime-water/wave-models\">Gerstner 波</a>，玩家脚边才开<a href=\"../realtime-water/interactive-water\">交互水面与涟漪</a>的高度场，只有核心玩法点（决堤、灌注）才动用<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH/FLIP</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>按距离降分辨率</strong>：远处 FFT 用 128×128、近处 512×512；远处高度场降采样。</li>\n<li><strong>按重要性限粒子</strong>：屏幕外、视锥外、距离远的粒子停止模拟或合并，活跃粒子数设硬上限。</li>\n<li><strong>休眠</strong>：静止水面（涟漪衰减到阈值以下）暂停更新，被扰动时再唤醒。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>LOD 切换的难点是接缝——不同档次的水交界处不能突变。常用距离区间内做混合过渡（crossfade 高度或法线），让玩家察觉不到方法切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多帧摊销与时间步管理\">多帧摊销与时间步管理</h2><p>即使单帧优化到位，峰值仍可能爆预算。两个时间维度的手段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>摊销（amortization）</strong>：把昂贵步骤分摊到多帧。例如表面重建每 2 帧做一次、中间插值；或把大网格的压力迭代分块轮流更新。代价是延迟，但对慢变的大水体几乎无感。</li>\n<li><strong>子步与固定时间步</strong>：流体稳定性受 CFL 约束（见<a href=\"../realtime-water/interactive-water\">交互水面与涟漪</a>），大时间步会爆。但每帧跑多个小子步又翻倍成本。折中是固定模拟时间步、与渲染帧率解耦，帧率波动时用插值补，既稳又省。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PBF/FLIP 这类位置约束法（见<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH 粒子流体</a>的 PBF 部分）的好处正在于能用大时间步还不爆，天然省子步成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台预算与移动端\">平台预算与移动端</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>典型流体预算</th>\n<th>可行方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PC/主机高端</td>\n<td>3-5 ms</td>\n<td>大规模 GPU SPH/FLIP + 屏幕空间渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主机/中端</td>\n<td>2-3 ms</td>\n<td>中等粒子 + FFT 海 + 高度场交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动端</td>\n<td>&lt; 1.5 ms</td>\n<td>几乎纯高度场/Gerstner，粒子仅局部小特效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>移动端是流体的修罗场：算力、带宽、发热全是硬约束，几乎不可能跑大规模粒子。务实做法是全程高度场水（Gerstner + 交互涟漪），粒子只用于刀光水花这类几十个粒子的局部小特效，表面重建一律屏幕空间且低分辨率。这套平台分级与<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/platform-optimization\">平台优化</a>的通用方法论一致，但流体的带宽敏感（每帧读写大量纹理/缓冲）要格外当心，是移动端最常见的隐形瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流体三大瓶颈：粒子邻域查找、网格压力投影、表面重建，各有对应优化。</li>\n<li>空间哈希把邻域搜索从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，GPU 上靠哈希排序让同格粒子内存连续、缓存友好。</li>\n<li>LOD 按距离与重要性切方法、降分辨率、限粒子、休眠，难点是接缝处做混合过渡。</li>\n<li>多帧摊销把昂贵步骤分摊降峰值；固定模拟时间步与渲染解耦，PBF/FLIP 大时间步天然省子步。</li>\n<li>移动端几乎只能高度场水 + 局部小特效粒子，且要警惕纹理/缓冲读写的带宽瓶颈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/fluid-basics-games\">游戏流体基础</a>、<a href=\"../methods/sph-particles\">SPH 粒子流体</a>、<a href=\"../realtime-water/ocean-fft\">海洋 FFT 频谱</a>、<a href=\"fluid-rendering\">流体渲染与表面重建</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/spatial-acceleration\">空间加速结构</a>、<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/practice/platform-optimization\">平台优化</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流体性能与 LOD","id":"流体性能与-lod"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：流体的三大瓶颈","id":"核心概念-流体的三大瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"空间哈希：压垮邻域查找","id":"空间哈希-压垮邻域查找"},{"level":2,"text":"LOD：按距离和重要性分级","id":"lod-按距离和重要性分级"},{"level":2,"text":"多帧摊销与时间步管理","id":"多帧摊销与时间步管理"},{"level":2,"text":"平台预算与移动端","id":"平台预算与移动端"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"流体渲染与表面重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/practice/fluid-rendering"},"next":{"title":"引擎集成与制作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fluid-simulation/practice/fluid-engine-integration"}}